# Calliar dataset.zip is too large to commit (51 MB) and the
# extracted/ tree is even larger. Both are pure build inputs;
# the canonical stroke trajectories we derive from them live
# in `build/seed/stroke_orders_seed.json`, which IS committed.
#
# To regenerate the dataset locally, run:
#   curl -sL -o dataset.zip \
#     https://github.com/ARBML/Calliar/raw/main/calliar_dataset/dataset.zip
#   unzip -q dataset.zip "dataset/*" -d extracted
#
# Then re-run `python3 build/extract_calliar_strokes.py`.

dataset.zip
extracted/
audit/
